      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This is my main issue using wireless. The disconnects wouldn't even be a big problem if it weren't for VRChat losing audio every time a disconnect occurred. \nEven Garry's Mod's audio with the Gmod VR mod comes back after a wireless headset disconnect/reconnect. \nPlease consider fixing this soon! Thank you.",
